   358	The proof of \pref{thm:randomhypergraphwhp} mostly follows the lines of the proof of \pref{thm:robust-asymmetry}. But we need some small modifications. For simplicity, we only prove the theorem  for $k=3$. For higher $k$, we encourage the readers to check by themselves. 
   359	
