   109	It is equivalent to replace (\ref{item:SOS-GISO}) by ``$\pE[(\sum_{v, v' : \{v,v'\} \in E(H)} \Pi[u \mapsto v] \Pi[u' \mapsto v'] - 1) \cdot q] = 0$ for all $(u, u') \in E(G)$ and all polynomials $q$''.
   110	\end{remark}
